Election
 └─ Button Click
      → create Count
      → create CountRound #1 (all Votes: CurrentCandidate__c = rank-1 pref, VoteOrigin__c = Original)

CountRound (insert)
 └─ CountRoundTrigger (after insert)
      └─ CountRoundTriggerHandler
           └─ enqueue CountOrchestratorQueueable(crId, mode=TALLY) [per CR]

CountOrchestratorQueueable
 ├─ mode=TALLY    → Database.executeBatch(VoteTallyBatch)
 └─ mode=TRANSFER → Database.executeBatch(SurplusTransferBatch)

VoteTallyBatch
 ├─ start()   → query Votes WHERE CurrentCandidate__c != null (this Election)
 ├─ execute() → group by CurrentCandidate__c → tally → CountEntry per candidate
 └─ finish()  → CountValidationService.evaluate(crId)
                → handleValidationResult(result)

SurplusTransferBatch
 ├─ start()   → query Votes WHERE CurrentCandidate__c = electedCandidateId
 │              split: VoteOrigin__c = Original | Transferred
 ├─ execute() → walk VP ranking → next continuing candidate
 │              compute transfer value (per chosen rule)
 │              update CurrentCandidate__c, VoteOrigin__c = Transferred
 │              write CountTransfer (aggregate, per source→dest per round)
 └─ finish()  → CountValidationService.evaluate(crId)
                → handleValidationResult(result)

CountValidationService.evaluate(crId)
 ├─ rank CountEntry by NoOfEffectiveVotes
 ├─ check quota → winner(s)?
 ├─ check remaining candidates == remaining seats → auto-elect
 ├─ else → lowest CE → exclusion candidate (+ tie-break)
 └─ return CountValidationResult:
      ELECTION_COMPLETE | NEEDS_SURPLUS_TRANSFER | NEEDS_EXCLUSION

handleValidationResult(result)
 ├─ ELECTION_COMPLETE      → mark Election/Count complete → STOP
 ├─ NEEDS_SURPLUS_TRANSFER → create CR(n+1) → enqueue Orchestrator(mode=TRANSFER)
 └─ NEEDS_EXCLUSION        → create CR(n+1), CE.Excluded=true
                              → enqueue Orchestrator(mode=TALLY)
                                 (or TRANSFER, if exclusions should log CountTransfer too)